    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d732">

                <pb facs="0852" n="842" sameAs="frus:frus1948v08/pg842"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.936/7–2848: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-07-28T20:00:00-04:00">July 28, 1948—8 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1083. Dept has received copy Operation Plan 103 (Embdesp 217 May 6) and copies
                    local emergency plans Peiping and Tientsin.<anchor n="63" xml:id="d732-f1"/>
                    Prior submission protection and evacuation question for consideration SANACC,
                    Dept desires receive copies local plans all posts as well as integrated plan
                    (Dept Cirair Apr 6, Para 5). Pls report present status these plans and
                    approximate dates completion and forwarding Dept.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
